{"text":"purananuru","n":48,"lines":["கோதை மார்பிற் கோதை யானும்","கோதையைப் புணர்ந்தோர் கோதை யானும்","மாக்கழி மலர்ந்த நெய்த லானும்","கள்நா றும்மே கானல்அம் தொண்டி","அஃதுஎம் ஊரே அவன்எம் இறைவன்","எம்மும் உள்ளுமோ முதுவாய் இரவல","அமர்மேம் படூஉங் காலை நின்","புகழ்மேம் படுநனைக் கண்டனம் எனவே"],"tr":["kōtai mārpiṟ kōtai yāṉum","kōtaiyaip puṇarntōr kōtai yāṉum","mākkaḻi malarnta neyta lāṉum","kaḷnā ṟummē kāṉalam toṇṭi","aḵtuem ūrē avaṉem iṟaivaṉ","emmum uḷḷumō mutuvāy iravala","amarmēm paṭūuṅ kālai niṉ","pukaḻmēm paṭunaṉaik kaṇṭaṉam eṉavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pāṭāṇ","tinai_ta":"பாடாண்","turai_ta":"புலவராற்றுப் படை","poet_ta":"பொய்கையார்","addressed_ta":"சேரமான் கோக்கோதை மார்பன்","poet_tr":"Poykaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"8 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"7×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 29, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 21, veṇṭaḷai 7, kalittaḷai 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கோதை","tr":"kōtai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோ","tr":"kō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"}]},{"text":"மார்பிற்","tr":"mārpiṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மார்","tr":"mār"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பிற்","tr":"piṟ"}]},{"text":"கோதை","tr":"kōtai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோ","tr":"kō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"}]},{"text":"யானும்","tr":"yāṉum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னும்","tr":"ṉum"}]}],[{"text":"கோதையைப்","tr":"kōtaiyaip","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோ","tr":"kō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யைப்","tr":"yaip"}]},{"text":"புணர்ந்தோர்","tr":"puṇarntōr","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புணர்ந்","tr":"puṇarn"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோர்","tr":"tōr"}]},{"text":"கோதை","tr":"kōtai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":