face":"உள்ளுமோ","parts":[{"text":"உள்ளுமோ","lemma":"உள்ளு","gloss":"will he think of"}],"gloss":"will he think of"},{"surface":"முதுவாய்","parts":[{"text":"முதுவாய்","lemma":"முதுவாய்","gloss":"wise-tongued"}],"gloss":"wise-tongued"},{"surface":"இரவல","parts":[{"text":"இரவல","lemma":"இரவலன்","gloss":"oh suppliant"}],"gloss":"oh suppliant"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அமர்மேம்","parts":[{"text":"அமர்","lemma":"அமர்","gloss":"battle"},{"text":"மேம்","lemma":"மேல்","gloss":"superiority"}],"gloss":"victory in battle"},{"surface":"படூஉங்","parts":[{"text":"படூஉங்","lemma":"படு","gloss":"occurring"}],"gloss":"occurring"},{"surface":"காலை","parts":[{"text":"காலை","lemma":"காலை","gloss":"time"}],"gloss":"time"},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"your"}],"gloss":"your"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புகழ்மேம்","parts":[{"text":"புகழ்","lemma":"புகழ்","gloss":"fame"},{"text":"மேம்","lemma":"மேல்","gloss":"superiority"}],"gloss":"fame-excelling"},{"surface":"படுநனைக்","parts":[{"text":"படுநனைக்","lemma":"படுநன்","gloss":"him who excels (accusative)"}],"gloss":"him who excels"},{"surface":"கண்டனம்","parts":[{"text":"கண்டனம்","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"we saw"}],"gloss":"we saw"},{"surface":"எனவே","parts":[{"text":"எனவே","lemma":"என","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"saying"}]}],"literal":"By the garland on the chest, and by the garland / of those who embraced Kōtai, and by the garland / of the blue water-lilies blossomed in the great backwater, / smells of honey indeed, beautiful Tondi on the seashore! / That is our town; he is our lord. / Will he think of us too, oh wise-tongued suppliant, / when you say, \"At the time when victory in battle is achieved, your / fame-excelling self we saw\"?","translation":"The beautiful seashore grove of Toṇṭi smells of sweet toddy and honey—from the garlands on the chest of Kōtai, from the garlands worn by those who embrace him, and from the blue water-lilies blooming in the dark backwaters. That is our town, and he is our lord. O wise-tongued suppliant! When you go to him and say, 'We saw you, whose fame rises high when victory is won in battle,' will he also remember us?","modern":"சேரமான் கோக்கோதை மார்பனின் மார்பில் அணிந்துள்ள மாலையினாலும், அவனைத் தழுவிய மகளிர் சூடியுள்ள மாலையினாலும், பெரிய கழிகளில் மலர்ந்துள்ள நெய்தல் மலர்களினாலும், அழகிய கடற்கரைச் சோலைகளைக் கொண்ட தொண்டி நகரம் தேன் மணம் வீசுகின்றது. அத்தகைய தொண்டி எங்களது ஊர்; அவன் எங்களது தலைவன். அறிவுமிக்க சொற்களை உடைய இரவலனே! 'போர்க்களத்தில் வெற்றி பெற்று மேம்படும் காலத்தில், உன்னுடைய புகழால் சிறந்த உன்னைக் கண்டோம்' என்று நீ அவனிடம் கூறும்போது, அவன் எங்களையும் நினைத்துப் பார்ப்பானோ?","explanation":"The poet Poykaiyār is addressing a wise suppliant who is on his way to visit the Cēra king Kōkkōtai Mārpaṉ. The poet describes the fragrant port city of Toṇṭi, which belongs to the king, and explains that its sweet scent comes from three sources: the king's own garlands, the garlands of those who embrace him, and the natural water-lilies of the backwaters. This rich imagery highlights the prosperity, intimacy, and beauty of the Cēra country. The poet asks the suppliant to praise the king's valor in battle and gently wonders if the king will remember the poet when he hears these praises. Key words include 'கோதை' (garland/Kōtai), 'தொண்டி' (Tondi), 'இறைவன்' (king/lord), and 'இரவல' (suppliant).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.0,1.2],[1.2,1.4],[1.4,1.97],[1.97,2.82],[2.82,3.1],[3.1,3.4],[3.4,3.66],[3.66,5.2],[5.2,5.4],[5.4,5.6],[5.89,6.32],[6.47,6.9],[6.9,7.5],[7.5,7.8],[7.8,8.37],[8.37,8.6],[8.6,9.2],[9.2,10.1],[10.1,11.0],[11.0,11.4],[11.4,11.9],[11.9,12.3],[12.3,13.42],[13.42,13.7],[13.7,14.3],[14.3,14.6],[14.6,15.47],[15.47,16.0],[16.0,16.4],[16.4,16.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.3],[1.3,1.6],[1.6,2.23],[2.23,3.18],[3.18,3.5],[3.5,3.9],[3.9,5.77],[5.77,6.27],[6.27,6.57],[6.57,7.1],[7.1,7.65],[7.65,8.19],[8.19,9.1],[9.1,9.5],[9.5,10.28],[10.28,10.59],[10.59,11.38],[11.38,12.0],[12.0,13.04],[13.43,13.8],[13.8,14.4],[14.4,14.9],[14.9,16.17],[16.17,16.5],[16.5,17.1],[17.1,17.3],[17.3,18.22],[18.22,18.7],[18.7,19.1],[19.1,19.6]]},"sync":[[["கோதை","garland"]],[["மார்பிற்","on the chest"]],[["கோதை","garland"]],[["யானும்","and by"]],[["கோதையைப்","Kōtai"]],[["புணர்ந்தோர்","those who embraced"]],[["கோதை","garland"]],[["யானும்","and by"]],[["மா","great"],["கழி","backwater"]],[["மலர்ந்த","blossomed"]],[["நெய்த","blue water-lily"]],[["லானும்","and by"]],[["கள்நா","smelling of honey"]],[["றும்மே","smells indeed"]],[["கானல்அம்","beautiful seashore grove"]],[["தொண்டி","Tondi"]],[["அஃதுஎம்","that is our"]],[["ஊரே","town indeed"]],[["அவன்எம்","he is our"]],[["இறைவன்","king/lord"]],[["எம்மும்","us too"]],[["உள்ளுமோ","will he think of"]],[["முதுவாய்","wise-tongued"]],[["இரவல","oh suppliant"]],[["அமர்மேம்","victory in battle"]],[["படூஉங்","occurring"]],[["காலை","time"]],[["நின்","your"]],[["புகழ்மேம்","fame-excelling"]],[["படுநனைக்","him who excels"]],[["கண்டனம்","we saw"]],[["எனவே","saying"]]]}